  "description": "Technicolor dark theme locked to Heart-Shaped Box + Oz dye-transfer: warm cobalt sky, orange-scarlet poppy, hospital cream paper, cool silver metal. No pure whites; blacks allowed pure.",
  "aesthetic": {
    "feel": [
      "hospital charcoal blacks with cream paper surfaces",
      "dye-transfer verse sky (warm cobalt, not LED cyan)",
      "Oz Munchkinland poppy scarlet-orange",
      "ochre dirt and flesh underpaint",
      "chrome silver jacket metal (cool ladder, never pure white)",
      "blue-to-red star field color shift, dulled ANSI brights"
    ],
    "inspiration": "Sampled against Heart-Shaped Box video frames, refined toward 1939 dye-transfer Technicolor / hand-painted cel density. In Utero hospital cream for UI panels. Original palette; not affiliated with rights holders.",
    "source_method": "ffmpeg frame grid + dye-transfer grade + pure-white ban + Oz warmer primaries"
  },
